window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-f08ff2349b471ec3"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"security\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">安全</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在页面 URL 后追加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该文档的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>安全控制项用于规定 ChatGPT 和 Codex 开发者工具可以访问什么内容，以及如何审查敏感操作。权限、沙盒、审批和网络访问共同构成信任边界。Codex Security 可以帮助查找和修复漏洞；网络安全使用指引则说明如何处理安全敏感型工作。</p> <p>控制 ChatGPT 和 Codex 开发者工具可以访问的内容，了解工作隔离方式，并为安全敏感型任务应用防护措施。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-4d7a5dc78b3c591e\">查看权限设置</a> <a id=\"permissions\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_2\">权限</h2> <p>控制文件系统、网络、命令、审批和审查行为。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-4d7a5dc78b3c591e\">权限</a> — 选择文件系统、命令和网络访问的权限配置方案。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-668fd22585595004\">沙盒</a> — 了解 Codex 如何隔离命令执行和文件修改。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-f464374c0d895ab1\">自动审查</a> — 根据已配置的策略自动审查操作。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b7af4e0dbfe643b3\">智能体审批与安全</a> — 决定 Codex 在执行某项操作前何时必须征求你的同意。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b99b352f5f4ffa98\">互联网访问</a> — 控制云端对话可以访问哪些域名。</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"codex-security\">Codex Security</h2> <p>查找、理解并修复漏洞。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d5a186b7366ebd04\">Codex Security 概览</a> — 评估代码，并将审查过的发现项转化为有针对性的修复。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-bec1e26cb654a758\">Codex Security 插件</a> — 在 ChatGPT 桌面应用和 Codex CLI 中运行安全工作流。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1716f9f1a07bca7e\">Codex Security CLI</a> — 运行本地安全扫描，并自动化仓库审查。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-13b97f7316a6bfd5\">Codex Security TypeScript SDK</a> — 将安全扫描和进度报告集成到开发者工具中。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-10cdc56de63926b8\">Codex Security Cloud 设置</a> — 安装 Cloud 插件、连接 GitHub 并开始安全扫描。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-862c857e0358aa15\">安全审查</a> — 对 GitHub 拉取请求执行深入的安全审查。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0c53ef5188800731\">威胁模型</a> — 检查并改进代码库的威胁模型。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2d8d28cbaa954fc4\">Codex Security Cloud 常见问题</a> — 了解云端扫描、发现项、隐私和访问权限相关问题。 <a id=\"cyber-safety\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_3\">网络安全</h2> <p>选择获准使用的模型，并为相关安全工作配置适当防护措施。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-04f6dcc4a4fe6044\">模型与可信访问</a> — 选择网络安全模型并申请 Trusted Access。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b74b7c76c711106d\">推荐配置</a> — 隔离运行环境、限制操作范围，并审查敏感操作。</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"security\">Security</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Security controls define what ChatGPT and Codex developer tools can access and how sensitive actions are reviewed. Permissions, sandboxing, approvals, and network access establish trust boundaries. Codex Security helps find and remediate vulnerabilities, and cyber safety guidance explains how security-sensitive work is handled.</p> <p>Control what ChatGPT and Codex developer tools can access, understand how work is isolated, and apply safeguards for security-sensitive tasks.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-4d7a5dc78b3c591e\">Explore permissions</a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"permissions\">Permissions</h2> <p>Control filesystem, network, command, approval, and review behavior.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-4d7a5dc78b3c591e\">Permissions</a> — Choose a profile for filesystem, command, and network access.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-668fd22585595004\">Sandboxing</a> — Understand how Codex isolates commands and file changes.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-f464374c0d895ab1\">Auto-review</a> — Review actions automatically against your configured policy.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b7af4e0dbfe643b3\">Agent approvals and security</a> — Decide when Codex must ask before taking an action.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b99b352f5f4ffa98\">Internet access</a> — Control which domains cloud chats can reach.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"codex-security\">Codex Security</h2> <p>Find, understand, and remediate vulnerabilities.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d5a186b7366ebd04\">Codex Security overview</a> — Assess code and turn reviewed findings into focused fixes.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-bec1e26cb654a758\">Codex Security plugin</a> — Run security workflows from the ChatGPT desktop app and Codex CLI.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1716f9f1a07bca7e\">Codex Security CLI</a> — Run local security scans and automate repository reviews.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-13b97f7316a6bfd5\">Codex Security TypeScript SDK</a> — Integrate security scanning and progress reporting into developer tools.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-10cdc56de63926b8\">Codex Security Cloud setup</a> — Install the Cloud plugin, connect GitHub, and start a security scan.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-862c857e0358aa15\">Security Review</a> — Run in-depth security reviews on GitHub pull requests.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0c53ef5188800731\">Threat model</a> — Review and improve the threat model for your codebase.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2d8d28cbaa954fc4\">Codex Security Cloud FAQ</a> — Get answers about cloud scans, findings, privacy, and access.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"cyber-safety\">Cyber safety</h2> <p>Choose approved models and configure safe engagements.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-04f6dcc4a4fe6044\">Models &amp; Trusted Access</a> — Choose a cybersecurity model and request Trusted Access.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b74b7c76c711106d\">Recommended configuration</a> — Isolate the environment, enforce scope, and review sensitive actions.</li> </ul>"};
